@@ -31621,6 +31621,13 @@
 
 Note that @option{-mcpu} does not override @option{-march} or @option{-mtune}.
 
+On RISC-V Linux, @option{-mcpu=native} expands to @option{-march=native} plus
+@option{-mtune=native} when those are not already set.  @option{-mtune=native}
+matches the running core against a small hardcoded table of
+@code{mvendorid}/@code{marchid}/@code{mimpid} values (SiFive @samp{u74}/
+@samp{p550}; SpacemiT @samp{x60}/@samp{x100}/@samp{a100} when those CPU names
+are present in this compiler).
+
